Portfolio Hub

Welcome to Portfolio Hub! This repository contains my personal portfolio project.

About
Portfolio Hub is a website/project created to showcase my work, projects, and personal portfolio.

How to Use

1. Open the Project
- Download or clone this repository.
- Extract the folder if you downloaded it as a ZIP.
- Open the project folder using Visual Studio Code.

2. Run the Website
- Locate `main.html` inside the project folder.
- Open it using your browser.
- For a better development experience, you can use the Live Server extension in VS Code.

3. Navigate the Website
- Explore the available sections and features through the website's navigation.
- Click buttons, links, and menu items to access the different sections.
- View the content and projects displayed on the portfolio.

4. Edit the Project
- Open the files in Visual Studio Code.
- Edit HTML for structure, CSS for design, and JavaScript for functionality.
- Save your changes and refresh the browser to see updates.

Technologies Used
- HTML
